{"id":"word:hebrew:H6466","type":"word","title":"פָּעַל","subtitle":"H6466 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to do or make (systematically and habitually), especially to practise","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to פָּעַל (H6466) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 56 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"פָּעַל (pâʻal) means to do or make (systematically and habitually), especially to practise First listed occurrence: Deut 32 27."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"פָּעַל","transliteration":"pâʻal","pronunciation":"paw-al'","strong":"H6466","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6466","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["פֹּ֣עֲלֵי","פֹּ֥עֲלֵי","פָּעַ֥לְתָּ","לְ/פֹ֣עֲלֵי","יִפְעַל"],"morphs":[["HVqrmpc",19],["HVqp2ms",6],["HVqp3ms",5],["HVqi3ms",5],["HR/Vqrmpc",4],["HVqp3cp",3],["HVqrmsa",2],["HVqi1cs",2],["HVqi2ms",2],["HVqp1cs",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"to do or make (systematically and habitually), especially to practise","usage":"commit, (evil-) do(-er), make(-r), ordain, work(-er).","full":"H6466. paal מָּעַל 57 verb do, make (in poetry for עָשָׂה ) (Late Hebrew מּוֺעֵל workman , compare Jewish-Aramaic; Phoenician פעל = Biblical Hebrew (often); Arabic id. ; Old Aramaic; פעל ; Syriac in derived species and derivatives ); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular Deut 32:27 +, אֵל פָ֫עַל Num 23:23 , 2 masculine singular מָּעַלְתָּ Exod 15:17 +, etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יִפְעַל Job 22:17 +; 2 masculine singular תִּפְעָלֿ 35:6 , etc.; Infinitive construct לְפָעְָלָם 37:12 (see below); Participle active מֹּעֵל Psa 15:2 +, plural construct מֹּעֲלֵי 5:6 +, etc.; — 1 do: a. of God, with accusative (abstract) Num 23:23 ; Deut 32:27 ; Job 33:29 , יְשׁוּעוֺת Psa 74:12 ; + ל person 31:20 ; 68:29 ; Isa 26:12 ; Job 22:17 ; with accusative of congnate meaning with verb מֹּעַל Psa 44:2 ; Hab 1:5 ; accusative omitted Isa 43:13 , compare 41:4 . b. of men, with accusative Psa 11:3 ; Job 11:8 , + ל person (God) 7:20 , + ב person (God) 35:6 ; especially of doing evil, שָׁ֑קֶר Hosea 7:1 , עָוֶל Job 34:32 , עַוְלָה 36:23 ; Psa 58:3 ; 119:3 , אָוֶן Prov 30:20 , especially אָוֶן מֹּעֲלֵי Hosea 6:8 ; Isa 31:2 ; Job 31:3 ; 34:8 , 22 ; Psa 5:6 15t. in Psalms, Prov 10:29 ; 21:15 , רָע מֹּעֲלֵי Micah 2:1 ; rarely of doing right, with accusative מִשְׁמָּטוֺ Zeph 2:3 , צֶדֶק Psa 15:2 . c. of clouds, with accusative Job 37:12 (disregarding ֑֯ ). 2 make ; a. of God, with accusative concrete Exod 15:17 ; + ל of thing Prov 16:4 , ל of 2nd object Psa 7:16 ; מֹּעֲלִי Job 36:3 my Maker. b. of man, with accusative concrete Isa 44:12 , 15 ; accusative omitted 44:12 ; Psa 7:16 . &#8212; Isa 1:31 see מֹּעַל .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Deut 32 27","keyReferences":["Deut 32 27","Exod 15 17","Hab 1 5","Hos 6 8","Hos 7 1","Isa 26 12","Isa 31 2","Isa 41 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":56,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Deut 32 27","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פָּעַ֥ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"Exod 15 17","book":"Exod","chapter":15,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פָּעַ֖לְתָּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp2ms"},{"reference":"Hab 1 5","book":"Hab","chapter":1,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פֹּעֵ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Hos 6 8","book":"Hos","chapter":6,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פֹּ֣עֲלֵי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmpc"},{"reference":"Hos 7 1","book":"Hos","chapter":7,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פָעֲל֖וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3cp"},{"reference":"Isa 26 12","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פָּעַ֥לְתָּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp2ms"},{"reference":"Isa 31 2","book":"Isa","chapter":31,"verse":2,"english